st></back><floats-wrap><fig id="f1-cin-01-32" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>MALDI-TOF spectrum of a pair of replicates A4 and A5. Shown are spectra before (a) and after (b) alignment. The corresponding lobster plots are shown in (c) and (d).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-01-32-g001"/></fig><fig id="f2-cin-01-32" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Five replicates from sample A. Shown are the spectrum (a and b) and corresponding lobster plot (c and d) before (a and c) and after (b and d) time warping.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-01-32-g002"/></fig><fig id="f3-cin-01-32" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Spectrum from two different biological samples A and B. (a) Replicates of sample A1 to A5. (b) Replicates of sample B1 to B5. (c): PCA plot of all spectra before (open symbols) and after (filled symbols) peak alignment. Note that one of the open triangles is hidden behind the filled triangles.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-01-32-g003"/><graphic xlink:href="CIN-01-32-g004"/></fig><fig id="f4-cin-01-32" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Comparison of initial data, FDA-aligned data, and alignment using prior information.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-01-32-g005"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-cin-01-32" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Percentage of variation explained by time warping</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Variance due to phase</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">/total variance</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">= % of variance due to phase</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Sample A</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.37</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.97</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84.98%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Sample B</bold></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.52</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.31</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">76.28%</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>